---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy - Recipe Nutrition Calculator"
	description="No accounts, no ad tracking. See what data this free recipe nutrition calculator processes and stores when you analyze a recipe."
	noindex
>
	<section class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-md sm:px-lg py-3xl">
		<h1 class="text-display-lg text-ink mb-lg">Privacy</h1>
		<div class="space-y-md text-body-md text-body">
			<p>We don't require an account, so we don't collect names, emails, or passwords for using the calculator.</p>
			<p>
				When you analyze a recipe, the ingredient text (and, for photo uploads, the image itself, transiently)
				is processed to compute nutrition data. The resulting nutrition analysis is stored so that its
				share link works, and is kept for up to 90 days. Photos are used only to transcribe text and are not
				retained after processing.
			</p>
			<p>
				When you paste a URL, we fetch that page's content server-side to look for its structured recipe data.
				We don't store the fetched page itself.
			</p>
			<p>
				Share links are public to anyone who has the link - they are not searchable or listed publicly, but
				treat them like any other unlisted link: don't share ones containing information you'd rather keep
				private.
			</p>
			<p>We don't sell data or share it with third parties for advertising.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
